:: MP Extra Jobs Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "High Street">><</if>>
<<set _bakSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobBakery) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
<<set _taiSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobTailor) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
<<set _couSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobCourier) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
<<set _pubSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobPubKitchen) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
<<set _staSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobStable) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
<<set _traSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobTrawler) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
高街转角那块旧木招工板下新添了一排铁夹，上面夹着六张手写招工木牌。木牌边缘沾着面粉、线头、火漆与海盐，显然是从不同街口刚送过来的。你拂去木牌表面的潮气，把六处差事的时辰与去向依次看了一遍。
<br><br>
各家铺面的差事如今都在对应街口直接招人（丰收街面包房与酒馆、高街裁缝铺、康努达图斯街代办亭、河湾马厩、梅尔街码头渔船），你也可以顺着木牌上的地址直接赶过去：
<br><br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[石炉面包房 <<print _bakSt>> (0:06)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link [[高街裁缝铺 <<print _taiSt>> (0:08)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[街巷跑腿行 <<print _couSt>> (0:05)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[查看郊外招工 (0:02)|MP Extra Jobs Outskirts Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Extra Jobs Outskirts Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _pubSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobPubKitchen) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
<<set _staSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobStable) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
<<set _traSt to ($daily and $daily.mpJobTrawler) ? "今日已歇" : "正在招手">>
木牌下半排夹着丰收街酒馆后厨、郊外马厩与旧港拖网船的招工木签，背面还挂着一册四季当班备忘录。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回上半排木牌 (0:02)|MP Extra Jobs Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[酒馆后厨 <<print _pubSt>> (0:08)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[马厩驮运 <<print _staSt>> (0:15)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<link [[近海渔船 <<print _traSt>> (0:12)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[翻看四季备忘录 (0:02)|MP Extra Job Supplement Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>


/* ==================== 1. 面包房早班 (Bakery) ==================== */

:: MP Job Bakery [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 19)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开石炉面包房 (0:02)|Harvest Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobBakeryCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
砖砌烤炉里透出烘麦芽与黄油的暖香，木案板上撒着一层细白面粉。烤面包师傅正用长柄木铲把第一炉黑麦圆包往铁架上挪，铁盘与砖壁摩擦出沉闷的声响。
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobBakery>>
	炉膛的火门已经半掩，你用过的亚麻手垫整齐地叠在面粉袋旁。<<elseif _stage gte 3 and ($mpJobBakeryPenalty or 0) is 0>>
	发酵室的小铜钥匙就挂在你的围裙扣上，师傅把刚出炉的一角热奶酥推到你手边，让你先垫垫肚子再看火。
<<else>>
	师傅敲了敲案板边缘的铁尺：「趁面团还没发过头，先把烤盘抹油排好，看准火候别烫着手。」
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>>后坊面案旁码着河湾农场直供的头茬红麦粉与干迷迭香。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 2>>海风咖啡馆预订的晨烤司康与奶油包竹篮已经排在侧门架上。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 2>>孤儿院浆洗房每天一早都会派院童来取热麦包与浆衣用的细腻麦粉。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Bakery">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Bakery">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobBakerySuspended or 0) is 1>>
	师傅把长柄木铲横在烤炉前，没让你碰案板。<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去炉房销假 (0:04)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobBakery)>>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[接下早班 (1:00)|MP Job Bakery Shift]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看早班排班 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
面包房已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Bakery Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobBakerySuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Bakery Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobBakeryCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回烤炉案台 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobBakery>>
	面包房早班的烤盘今日已经全部出炉收架，案板擦得干干净净。
<<else>>
早市的钟声刚响过第一遍，三层铁烤架上的黑麦面团已经鼓起饱满的弧度，前厅橱窗外排起了买热面包的街坊。炉温正高，热浪扑在脸上让人鼻尖冒汗，师傅在案板另一头喊你搭手。
<<if random(1, 3) is 1>>
<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Bakery Winter">>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Bakery Rain">>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Bakery Festival">>
<<elseif Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Bakery Spring">>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Bakery Summer">>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 3>><<link [[看管主炉 (1:00)|MP Job Bakery Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($tending or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (420 + _stage * 180 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobBakeryPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 80 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你掐准麦香转浓的瞬间抽动木铲，十二只黑麦圆包外壳金黄酥脆，没有一只焦底。前厅熟客连声夸赞，顺手在木托盘上多压了几枚硬币。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你抽铲慢了半拍，最里排的面包底壳焦黑冒烟，苦味顿时漫过前厅。师傅皱眉拉开排风窗，让你先把焦炭刮干净，这一班没法算工钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobBakery to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[看管主炉 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "看管主炉">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管发酵室钥匙）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 200 or ($tending or 0) gte 210 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[折叠起酥 (1:00)|MP Job Bakery Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($science or 0), ($tending or 0))>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _tier to (_sk gte 320 or _stage gte 4 ? 3 : (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 2 ? 2 : 1))>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (400 + _tier * 35 + _stage * 175 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobBakeryPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 75 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你按三折四次的标准工序将冷黄油裹入面皮，分小号、中号、大号三档卷出三十六层牛角酥。出炉时酥皮如金叶般层层绽开，送奶工内尔与咖啡馆学徒当场抢购一空。" : "你在冷案板上稳稳擀开黄油面团，烤出的杏仁起酥层次分明，老师傅满意地记下工钱。")>>
		<<set $mpJobReg_Bakery_2 to ($mpJobReg_Bakery_2 or 0) + 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "掌温太高把黄油揉化进了面团，烤出来的牛角包死硬不起层，整盘只能留作员工干粮，这一班没法算工钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobBakery to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[折叠起酥 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "折叠起酥">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[前台收银 (1:00)|MP Job Bakery Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($housekeeping or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 250 or _stage gte 2 or random(170, 260) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (380 + _stage * 160 + Math.floor(_sk / 6) - (($mpJobBakeryPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 70 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你利落地用长面包刀切开刚出炉的核桃长棍，油纸折角严丝合缝，找零更是分毫不差。赶着上工的客人们满意地拎包离开。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "热面包表皮太脆，你下刀急了，把两只核桃长棍压得塌成一团，油纸袋也扯破了口。师傅叹了口气接过面包刀，让你先退到后头收拾碎屑。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobBakery to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[前台收银 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "前台收银">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已熟稔早市切包）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[筛粉刷盘 (1:00)|MP Job Bakery Settle]]>>
	<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) + 1>>
	<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (310 + _stage * 90 - (($mpJobBakeryPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 50 : 0)))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "你守着细铜筛把三大袋麦粉筛得松软均匀，又用猪鬃刷把冷却的铁烤盘擦得锃亮。活计虽然单调，却没出半点差错。">>
	<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobBakery to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Job Bakery Progress [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobBakeryCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
你站在发酵室木架旁，查看墙上的木号牌与订户竹篮。
<br><br>
<<if _stage is 0>>
	你才刚摸清烤炉脾气，师傅只让你在旁边递铁盘、看沙漏，连主炉风门都不让你单手碰。
<<elseif _stage is 1>>
	师傅已经肯让你独自看管第一炉黑麦包，早起买面包的街坊也开始认得你的脸。
<<elseif _stage is 2>>
	前厅的熟客会特意等你揭开黄油起酥的盖布，师傅偶尔让你自己调配肉桂糖霜。
<<elseif _stage is 3>>
	发酵室的小铜钥匙已经交给你随身带着。
<<else>>
	整间面包房早班最要紧的甜面团都由你亲手揉制。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Bakery">>
<br><br>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回烤炉 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[看烘焙当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<if ($mpJobBakerySuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去烤炉房复工 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery Remedy]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<elseif ($mpJobBakeryStrike or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobBakeryPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<link [[补早炉差错 (0:03)|MP Job Bakery StrikeFix]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Bakery Duties [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你站在发酵室木牌前查看今日的烘焙专办与老酵养护。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回烘焙排班 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 3>><<mpcookicon>><<link [[招呼老太太 (0:06)|MP Job Followup Bakery]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryBakery or 0) lt 3>><<mpreadicon>><<link [[调养传世老酵 (0:06)|MP Job Story Bakery 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobBakery>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[查看炉房急务 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery Duties Extra]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Bakery Duties Extra [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
发酵室侧面小黑板上记着今日当班的炉房抢修与搭档加急单。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回烘焙活计 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[抢修石炉火门 (0:05)|MP Job Extra Bakery 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[合烤加急喜饼 (0:05)|MP Job Partner Bakery 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Job Bakery Remedy [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobBakerySuspended or 0) isnt 1>><<goto "MP Job Bakery Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
由于连续三次在炉前出岔子，师傅暂时收走了你的亚麻手垫。<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[送面包去孤儿院 (0:15)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobBakerySuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobBakeryPenalty to 0>>
		<<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 15>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>><<link [[核对面粉账 (0:12)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>>
		<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobBakerySuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobBakeryPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress -1>><<pass 12>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 12>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[核对面粉账 (0:12)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "核对面粉账">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 12>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<link [[刷净烟道 (0:14)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>>
		<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobBakerySuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobBakeryPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 14>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[刷净烟道 (0:14)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "刷净烟道">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 14>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Bakery StrikeFix [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobBakeryStrike or 0) is 2 or ($mpJobBakeryPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	师傅因你先前的失误收起了铜钥匙，分成也压低了一截。
	<br><br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[替晚班揉面 (0:12)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobBakeryPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 12>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>><<link [[请主顾美言 (0:06)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>>
		<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
			<<set $mpJobBakeryPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to 1>><<stress -1>><<pass 6>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 3>><<pass 6>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[请主顾美言 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "请主顾美言">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif ($mpJobBakeryStrike or 0) is 1>>
	师傅还记着你上一回烤焦面包的失误，提醒你这几天手脚放稳些。
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦净案板 (0:06)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Bakery Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Bakery Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobBakeryCount to ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobBakeryCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobBakeryCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<print ($mpJobResultText or "你解下沾着面粉的围裙，把烤盘归置回铁架上。")>>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
	<<money $mpJobResultPay>><<tending 1>><<housekeeping 1>>
	<<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>><<money 120>>师傅笑着说河湾农场送来的头茬红麦成色极佳，额外给你多添了一枚分成硬币。<</if>>
	师傅从木抽屉里点出工钱塞进你手心，温热的硬币还带着烤炉边的暖意。
	<<if ($mpJobBakeryStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobBakeryStrike - 1)>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set _msClaimed to (_stage gte 3 and window.dolmp and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_bakery_milestone"))>>
	<<if !_msClaimed>>
		<<set _ev to random(1, 5)>>
		<<switch _ev>>
		<<case 1>><<include "MP Job Random Bakery 1">>
		<<case 2>><<include "MP Job Random Bakery 2">>
		<<case 3>><<include "MP Job Random Bakery 3">>
		<<case 4>><<include "MP Job Random Bakery 4">>
		<<case 5>><<include "MP Job Random Bakery 5">>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _stage gte 3>>
		<<if _msClaimed>>
			<br><br>
			收工前，师傅把发酵室的备用黄铜钥匙和一封厚实的红纸赏封推到你面前：「往后早炉的火候，你能独当一面了。」
			<<money 1600>><<stress -3>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobBakeryStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobBakeryStrike or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if $mpJobBakeryStrike is 2>><<set $mpJobBakeryPenalty to 1>><<elseif $mpJobBakeryStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobBakerySuspended to 1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpJobBakeryStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Bakery 1">>
	<<elseif $mpJobBakeryStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Bakery 2">>
	<<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Bakery 3">><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0 and !($daily and $daily.mpJobBakeryEncounter)>>
	前厅木柜边忽然有人敲了敲订户牌，老师傅回头唤你过去搭手。
	<br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[炉前有人唤你 (0:05)|MP Job Bakery Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去查看情况 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Bakery]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

/* ==================== 2. 裁缝铺改衣 (Tailor) ==================== */

:: MP Job Tailor [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 8 and Time.hour lt 20)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开高街裁缝铺 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTailorCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
高街裁缝铺的木门后挂着厚绒门帘，空气里浮动着蒸汽熨斗与羊毛呢料的气息。老裁缝戴着老花镜坐在靠窗的脚踏缝纫机前，手边放着一盒按色号排开的蚕丝线轴。
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobTailor>>
	你的针线包已经收进抽屉，木人台上的礼服也罩上了防尘白布。<<elseif _stage gte 3 and ($mpJobTailorPenalty or 0) is 0>>
	副台最顺手的那把镀银裁布剪专门留给了你，老裁缝把几张加急的私密改衣单直接压在你的软尺下。
<<else>>
	老裁缝用粉笔在呢料边缘画了一道白线：「先把客人们送来收腰放摆的衣服挑开旧线，针脚要密，别扎破了里衬。」
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 2>>工作台下整齐码着孤儿院浆洗房预缩水并熨平的上等亚麻衬布。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 2>>多瑙河街温泉桑拿房常将私汤贵客的丝绸浴袍与礼服转介到铺子里精修。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 6>>街巷跑腿行的邮差每天下午准点来取封装妥当的改衣礼盒。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Tailor">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Tailor">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobTailorSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	老裁缝用绒布盖住了副台上的缝纫机。<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去裁铺销假 (0:04)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobTailor)>>
	<<mptailoricon>><<link [[戴顶针上工 (1:00)|MP Job Tailor Shift]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[看改衣排班 (0:03)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
裁缝铺已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Tailor Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobTailorSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Tailor Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTailorCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回裁衣案台 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobTailor>>
	裁缝铺今日的改衣单已经全部熨平挂妥，踏板缝纫机上了防尘罩。
<<else>>
午后的试衣间门帘不时掀动，衣架上挂满了等待收腰、换衬里和钉暗扣的礼服与制服。老裁缝踩着踏板发出规律的哒哒声，把几件标着取衣钟点的衣裳推到你的工作台边。
<<if random(1, 3) is 1>>
<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Tailor Winter">>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Tailor Rain">>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Tailor Festival">>
<<elseif Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Tailor Spring">>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Tailor Summer">>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 3>><<link [[暗针改衬 (1:00)|MP Job Tailor Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($skulduggery or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 270 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 280) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (450 + _stage * 185 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobTailorPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 90 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你用极细的盲针将丝绸内衬缝合得看不出半点针眼，暗袋与隐扣位置分毫不差。来取衣的熟客试穿后十分满意，当场留下了丰厚的手工赏钱。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你拆线时手腕一抖，拆线刀划开了丝绸礼服的袖笼内衬。老裁缝立刻伸手按住布料，让你退到一旁去绕线轴，这一单的手工费彻底泡了汤。">>
		<<stress 6>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTailor to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[暗针改衬 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "暗针改衬">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已获配镀银裁布剪）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 200 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 200 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[立裁量体 (1:00)|MP Job Tailor Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($maths or 0), ($seductionskill or 0))>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _tier to (_sk gte 320 or _stage gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (420 + _tier * 35 + _stage * 175 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobTailorPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 80 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你在木人台上按平装、便礼服、首演华服三档精准别好斜裁珠针，肩线与腰省一气呵成，克拉拉夫人与舞者伊芙琳试穿后连声称绝。" : "你用软尺量准主顾肩宽与袖长，粉笔打版线条干净利落，老裁缝点头收下尺码卡。")>>
		<<set $mpJobReg_Tailor_1 to ($mpJobReg_Tailor_1 or 0) + 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "量体时漏算了抬臂余量，裁出的样布紧绷在腋下，老裁缝让你拆掉珠针重头再量，这班没算工钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTailor to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[立裁量体 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "立裁量体">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "算术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[熨烫大衣 (1:00)|MP Job Tailor Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($housekeeping or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 250 or _stage gte 2 or random(170, 260) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (390 + _stage * 165 + Math.floor(_sk / 6) - (($mpJobTailorPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 75 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你隔着湿亚麻布用重锤熨斗稳稳压过羊毛大衣的翻领，折痕挺括利落，连陈年褶皱都被熨得平平整整。老裁缝点点头，把手工钱记在了你的单子上。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "熨斗在袖口停得久了两秒，浅灰羊毛呢面上顿时留下一块刺眼的焦黄印子。老裁缝急忙拿湿布抢救，沉着脸宣布你今天没有工钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTailor to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[熨烫大衣 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "熨烫大衣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管副台熨斗）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[分拣纽扣 (1:00)|MP Job Tailor Settle]]>>
	<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) + 1>>
	<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (320 + _stage * 90 - (($mpJobTailorPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 50 : 0)))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "你把三大盒混杂的贝壳扣、牛角扣与包布扣按尺寸归入木格，又将裁剩下的丝绒边角料捆扎整齐。老裁缝照例给了你一份基础辛劳钱。">>
	<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTailor to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Job Tailor Progress [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTailorCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
你站在铜镜旁翻看墙钩上的改衣尺码卡。
<br><br>
<<if _stage is 0>>
	你还在跟着老裁缝学挑旧线和钉普通铜扣，贵重绸缎一律不许你单独下剪。
<<elseif _stage is 1>>
	老裁缝开始让你独立处理学校制服的收腰与裙摆改短，针脚已经看不出歪斜。
<<elseif _stage is 2>>
	你开始接手多瑙河街熟客的改衣委托，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>路过时也会点头称赞你的配色眼光。
<<elseif _stage is 3>>
	那把最锋利的镀银裁布剪归了你专用。
<<else>>
	城里最挑剔的晚礼服与假面舞会披肩都指名交给你改制。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Tailor">>
<br><br>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回工作台 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看裁铺当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<if ($mpJobTailorSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mpsewicon>><<link [[去裁缝台复工 (0:03)|MP Job Tailor Remedy]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<elseif ($mpJobTailorStrike or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobTailorPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<link [[补针脚差错 (0:03)|MP Job Tailor StrikeFix]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Tailor Duties [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你翻开裁缝台旁的预约簿，核对今日的熟客改衣与首演华服工序。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回改衣排班 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) gte 3>><<mpsewicon>><<link [[加固燕尾服 (0:07)|MP Job Followup Tailor]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryTailor or 0) lt 3>><<mptailoricon>><<link [[赶制首演华服 (0:06)|MP Job Story Tailor 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobTailor>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[查看裁衣急务 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor Duties Extra]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Tailor Duties Extra [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
裁缝台侧面的竹篮里放着今日急需抢修的衣车零件与搭档改衣单。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回改衣活计 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[抢修断针衣车 (0:05)|MP Job Extra Tailor 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[合改加急礼服 (0:05)|MP Job Partner Tailor 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Job Tailor Remedy [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobTailorSuspended or 0) isnt 1>><<goto "MP Job Tailor Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
因为接连弄坏衣料，你的副工作台被锁上了抽屉。<br><br>
	<<mptailoricon>><<link [[送礼服 (0:15)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobTailorStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorPenalty to 0>>
		<<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 15>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpsewicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>><<link [[暗针补衬 (0:14)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>>
		<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>>
			<<set $mpJobTailorStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress -1>><<pass 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 14>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[暗针补衬 (0:14)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "暗针补衬">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 14>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<link [[清点丝线卡 (0:12)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>>
		<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobTailorStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 12>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 12>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[清点丝线卡 (0:12)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "清点丝线卡">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 12>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Tailor StrikeFix [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobTailorStrike or 0) is 2 or ($mpJobTailorPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	老裁缝暂时收回了你的镀银裁布剪与私密改衣抽成，只让你做最普通的基础活计。
	<br><br>
	<<mptailoricon>><<link [[锁裤脚边 (0:12)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobTailorPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorStrike to 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 12>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[请熟客求情 (0:06)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>>
		<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobTailorPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobTailorStrike to 1>><<stress -1>><<pass 6>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 3>><<pass 6>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[请熟客求情 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "请熟客求情">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<<elseif ($mpJobTailorStrike or 0) is 1>>
	老裁缝还记着你上次烫坏布料的失误，经过你身边时总会多看一眼你的手势。
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[扫净线头 (0:05)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobTailorStrike to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 5>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Tailor Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Tailor Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobTailorCount to ($mpJobTailorCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTailorCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTailorCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<print ($mpJobResultText or "你把银针插回绒布针包，将软尺卷好放回抽屉。")>>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
	<<money $mpJobResultPay>><<housekeeping 1>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 2>><<money 120>>老裁缝夸孤儿院浆洗房送来的衬布浆烫得平直，给你多算了一份手工津贴。<</if>>
	老裁缝推了推鼻梁上的老花镜，把算好的手工钱放在你的软尺旁边。
	<<if ($mpJobTailorStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobTailorStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobTailorStrike - 1)>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set _msClaimed to (_stage gte 3 and window.dolmp and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_tailor_milestone"))>>
	<<if !_msClaimed>>
		<<set _ev to random(1, 5)>>
		<<switch _ev>>
		<<case 1>><<include "MP Job Random Tailor 1">>
		<<case 2>><<include "MP Job Random Tailor 2">>
		<<case 3>><<include "MP Job Random Tailor 3">>
		<<case 4>><<include "MP Job Random Tailor 4">>
		<<case 5>><<include "MP Job Random Tailor 5">>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _stage gte 3>>
		<<if _msClaimed>>
			<br><br>
			打烊时，老裁缝打开红木匣，取出一把镌刻花纹的镀银裁布剪与一叠整钞递给你：「从今往后，店里的急单与私密委托都准你直接接手。」
			<<money 1800>><<stress -3>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobTailorStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobTailorStrike or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if $mpJobTailorStrike is 2>><<set $mpJobTailorPenalty to 1>><<elseif $mpJobTailorStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobTailorSuspended to 1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpJobTailorStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Tailor 1">>
	<<elseif $mpJobTailorStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Tailor 2">>
	<<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Tailor 3">><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0 and !($daily and $daily.mpJobTailorEncounter)>>
	试衣间外的铜铃忽然急促响了两声，一位熟客正掀帘唤人。
	<br>
	<<mptailoricon>><<link [[试衣间外响铃 (0:05)|MP Job Tailor Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<br><br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link [[查看改衣单 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前厅 (0:02)|MP Job Tailor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

/* ==================== 3. 街巷跑腿邮差 (Courier) ==================== */

:: MP Job Courier [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 7 and Time.hour lt 21)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开邮政代办亭 (0:02)|Connudatus Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobCourierCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
高街邮政代办亭的绿漆木窗半开着，亭内堆着按街区捆好的牛皮纸信袋与加急包裹。老邮差正往帆布挎包上抹防雨蜡，脚边放着一串铜铃与签收夹板。
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobCourier>>
	你的帆布邮差包已经挂回木钩，签收簿上盖满了今天的回执印章。老邮差摆摆手让你去歇脚。
<<elseif _stage gte 3 and ($mpJobCourierPenalty or 0) is 0>>
	老邮差把那双防滑胶底快步靴和远线专送铜牌递给你，连多瑙河街与码头的加急件都放心交给你跑。
<<else>>
	老邮差拍了拍帆布包：「先把住宅区和近街的信件按门牌分好，注意别让雨水打湿了封口。」
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 2>>高街钟表铺将精密怀表件与外埠游丝的加急专送全包给了代办亭。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTailorCount or 0) gte 6>>你的帆布邮包经高街裁缝铺用双股蜡线加固过，防雨又耐磨。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobStableCount or 0) gte 6>>河湾马厩在镇口备了换乘快马，随时接应你的远线加急邮袋。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Courier">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Courier">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobCourierSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	老邮差把帆布挎包挂在窗口内侧，没递给你。因为接连送错信件，你已被暂停派件，得先去把漏送的回执处理干净。
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去邮亭销假 (0:04)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobCourier)>>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[背邮包出班 (1:00)|MP Job Courier Shift]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看派送排班 (0:03)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
代办亭已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Courier Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobCourierSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Courier Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobCourierCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回代办窗口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobCourier>>
	代办亭今日的跨街急件已经悉数派完，帆布邮包整齐挂回木钩。
<<else>>
街口的报时钟敲过整点，帆布挎包里塞满了封着红蜡的商行急件与住户包裹。石板路被晨雾润得微滑，几条近道小巷里不时有野狗与推车穿行。
<<if random(1, 3) is 1>>
<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Courier Winter">>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Courier Rain">>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Courier Festival">>
<<elseif Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Courier Spring">>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Courier Summer">>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 3>><<link [[派送急件 (1:00)|MP Job Courier Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 270 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 280) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (440 + _stage * 180 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobCourierPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 85 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你脚下生风地翻过住宅区与商业巷的矮墙捷径，赶在商行截单前把六封火漆急件全部送达。收件掌柜痛快地在夹板上签了名，还额外赏了跑腿费。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你在湿滑的砖巷拐角被运货推车堵了去路，等气喘吁吁赶到商行时已经过了截单钟点。老邮差看着退回来的急件直叹气，今天这趟没法给你算工钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourier to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[派送急件 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "派送急件">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已获配远线铜牌）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 200 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[夜巷专送 (1:00)|MP Job Courier Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($skulduggery or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _tier to (_sk gte 320 or _stage gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (410 + _tier * 35 + _stage * 170 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobCourierPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 75 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你按普通函、火漆急件、锡皮保温匣三档排定路线，穿行连廊暗道，赶在整点钟响前将钟表铺游丝与药房安瓿双双交割完毕。" : "你借着街巷阴影避开拥堵车流，把商行密函稳妥送达收件人手中。")>>
		<<set $mpJobReg_Courier_2 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_2 or 0) + 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "抄近道时拐进了死胡同，等绕回正街已经过了约定交接时辰，这一趟白跑了。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourier to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[夜巷专送 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "夜巷专送">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[送件面签 (1:00)|MP Job Courier Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($english or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 250 or _stage gte 2 or random(170, 260) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (390 + _stage * 160 + Math.floor(_sk / 6) - (($mpJobCourierPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 70 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你仔细辨认出被雨水洇开的旧街牌缩写，准确敲开了多瑙河街与狼街的三户偏门。住户们核对完火漆印章，客气地把签收条与小费递回你手里。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你把两户拼写相近的街牌看混了，包裹送错了门院，害得你来回折腾了半下午才追回来。老邮差板着脸收下迟到的回执，这一班算是白跑了。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourier to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[送件面签 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "送件面签">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已熟记各街门牌）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[分拣信件 (1:00)|MP Job Courier Settle]]>>
	<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) + 1>>
	<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (310 + _stage * 90 - (($mpJobCourierPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 50 : 0)))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "你站在分拣木格前把两百封平信按街名理顺，咔哒咔哒地盖清每一枚日期戳。虽然手腕有些发酸，但一封也没漏。">>
	<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourier to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Job Courier Progress [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobCourierCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
你站在邮政代办亭的街区图前查看派送近道。
<br><br>
<<if _stage is 0>>
	你目前只负责宅邸街与高街周边的平信，老邮差要求你每送完一趟都得回来对一遍回执。
<<elseif _stage is 1>>
	你已经记熟了住宅区小巷的门牌跳号规律，不用看地图也能避开死胡同。
<<elseif _stage is 2>>
	老邮差开始把带火漆的商行专送件交给你，连巡夜的<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>见了你都会让开道口。
<<elseif _stage is 3>>
	你领到了一枚远线专送铜牌与油布防雨套。
<<else>>
	全镇最机密的夜间加急信函都指名由你传递。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Courier">>
<br><br>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回窗口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看邮亭当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Courier Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<if ($mpJobCourierSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去代办亭复工 (0:03)|MP Job Courier Remedy]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<elseif ($mpJobCourierStrike or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobCourierPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<link [[补漏件差错 (0:03)|MP Job Courier StrikeFix]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Courier Duties [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你对照代办亭墙上的时刻表，盘算着今日的专送急件与街坊差事。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回派送排班 (0:02)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 3>><<mpcarryicon>><<link [[专送药匣 (0:08)|MP Job Followup Courier]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryCourier or 0) lt 3>><<mpmapicon>><<link [[测绘暗巷密图 (0:06)|MP Job Story Courier 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobCourier>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[抢救淋雨邮包 (0:05)|MP Job Extra Courier 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Courier Remedy [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobCourierSuspended or 0) isnt 1>><<goto "MP Job Courier Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
由于连续误了急件钟点，老邮差暂时扣下了你的帆布挎包。<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[送报到校 (0:15)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobCourierStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierPenalty to 0>>
		<<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 15>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<mptranslateicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260>><<link [[重誊退信单 (0:12)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>>
		<<if ($english or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobCourierStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress -1>><<pass 12>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 12>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[重誊退信单 (0:12)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "重誊退信单">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 12>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270>><<link [[补拿回执 (0:14)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>>
		<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270>>
			<<set $mpJobCourierStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 14>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[补拿回执 (0:14)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "补拿回执">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 14>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Courier StrikeFix [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobCourierStrike or 0) is 2 or ($mpJobCourierPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	老邮差暂时收走了你的远线专送铜牌与油布套，只给你派最零碎的平信活。
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收齐信筒 (0:14)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobCourierPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierStrike to 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 14>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[请掌柜担保 (0:06)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>>
		<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobCourierPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobCourierStrike to 1>><<stress -1>><<pass 6>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 3>><<pass 6>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[请掌柜担保 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "请掌柜担保">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<<elseif ($mpJobCourierStrike or 0) is 1>>
	老邮差还记着你上一趟送迟的差错，叮嘱你路上少看热闹。
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[给邮包上蜡 (0:06)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobCourierStrike to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Courier Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Courier Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobCourierCount to ($mpJobCourierCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobCourierCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobCourierCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<print ($mpJobResultText or "你把盖好章的签收夹板交还到代办亭窗口。")>>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
	<<money $mpJobResultPay>><<athletics 1>>
	<<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 2>><<money 120>>老邮差提到高街钟表铺托运的精密表件准时送达，把商行加付的脚力钱一并塞给了你。<</if>>
	老邮差核对完回执数目，从铁皮钱匣里数出跑腿工钱递到你手里。
	<<if ($mpJobCourierStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobCourierStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobCourierStrike - 1)>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set _msClaimed to (_stage gte 3 and window.dolmp and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_milestone"))>>
	<<if !_msClaimed>>
		<<set _ev to random(1, 5)>>
		<<switch _ev>>
		<<case 1>><<include "MP Job Random Courier 1">>
		<<case 2>><<include "MP Job Random Courier 2">>
		<<case 3>><<include "MP Job Random Courier 3">>
		<<case 4>><<include "MP Job Random Courier 4">>
		<<case 5>><<include "MP Job Random Courier 5">>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _stage gte 3>>
		<<if _msClaimed>>
			<br><br>
			收工时，老邮差把一枚磨得发亮的远线专送铜牌和一笔准点奖金塞进你掌心：「往后跨街区的急件，全交给你调度了。」
			<<money 1700>><<stress -3>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobCourierStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobCourierStrike or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if $mpJobCourierStrike is 2>><<set $mpJobCourierPenalty to 1>><<elseif $mpJobCourierStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobCourierSuspended to 1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpJobCourierStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Courier 1">>
	<<elseif $mpJobCourierStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Courier 2">>
	<<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Courier 3">><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0 and !($daily and $daily.mpJobCourierEncounter)>>
	代办亭木窗被人笃笃敲响，一份加急件正递进窗口。
	<br>
	<<windowicon>><<link [[窗口递来急单 (0:05)|MP Job Courier Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<br><br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[查看路线 (0:02)|MP Job Courier Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回窗口 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

/* ==================== 4. 丰收酒馆后厨 (PubKitchen) ==================== */

:: MP Job PubKitchen [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 10 and Time.hour lt 23)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回酒馆前厅 (0:02)|Pub]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
丰收街酒馆的后厨弥漫着炖牛肉、麦芽酒与烤马铃薯的浓香。两口大铁锅在灶上咕嘟作响，掌勺厨娘正用大铁勺撇去浮沫，水槽边摞着高高一叠锡制酒盘。
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobPubKitchen>>
	灶火已经压成了暗炭，你用过的粗布围裙晾在通风口边。厨娘朝你挥挥木勺，让你今天先回去歇着。
<<elseif _stage gte 3 and ($mpJobPubKitchenPenalty or 0) is 0>>
	厨娘把小灶上的员工热汤碗盛满推给你，连酒窖副匙和招牌烤肉的火候都放心交给你盯着。
<<else>>
	厨娘用木勺敲了敲案板：「晚市酒客多，手脚麻利点，别把热汁洒在传菜口。」
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>>水池边的碎冰筐里码着海礁鱼档今日特供的去刺银鳕鱼柳。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 6>>旧港拖网船返航时总会把最新鲜的大青蟹与深水鱼直供后厨，并顺带捎走船员御寒的麦酒。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobStableCount or 0) gte 6>>河湾马厩每日收走后厨温热的黑麦酒糟作挽马精料，并替酒馆运来整桶新酿黑啤。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "PubKitchen">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "PubKitchen">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	厨娘挡在传菜口前，没让你进灶台区。由于接连砸锅误菜，你已被暂停后厨班次，得先把积压的清洁或地窖活干完。
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去后厨销假 (0:04)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobPubKitchen)>>
	<<mptailoricon>><<link [[系围裙进后厨 (1:00)|MP Job PubKitchen Shift]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看后厨排班 (0:03)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
酒馆后厨已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job PubKitchen Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后厨灶台 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobPubKitchen>>
	丰收酒馆后厨今日的烤盘与酒桶已经清点归位，灶火彻底封好。
<<else>>
前厅酒客的喧哗声隔着摆门传进来，传菜铃接连不断地响起。铁板上的香肠滋滋冒油，地窖楼梯口还堆着刚送来的四桶黑麦啤酒。
<<if random(1, 3) is 1>>
<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal PubKitchen Winter">>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal PubKitchen Rain">>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal PubKitchen Festival">>
<<elseif Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal PubKitchen Spring">>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">><<include "MP Job Seasonal PubKitchen Summer">>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 3>><<link [[掌烤肉出餐 (1:00)|MP Job PubKitchen Settle]]>><<mpalert 4>>
	<<set _sk to ($housekeeping or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (430 + _stage * 180 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobPubKitchenPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 80 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你握稳厚背餐刀将烤肋排切得厚薄一致，浇上滚烫的黑椒肉汁准时推出传菜窗。前厅跑堂带回一叠拼桌酒客留下的打赏铜币。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "油星溅上手背，你缩手时打翻了整盅黑椒肉汁，滚烫的酱汁把刚装盘的三份烤肉全泡了汤。厨娘黑着脸把盘子撤下，今天这班没有工钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchen to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertgain "烤肉油脂在铁板上爆响">><<else>><<link [[掌烤肉出餐 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "掌烤肉出餐">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管招牌烤肉）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 200 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[猛火炸鱼排 (1:00)|MP Job PubKitchen Settle]]>><<mpalert 5>>
	<<set _sk to ($tending or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _tier to (_sk gte 320 or _stage gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (420 + _tier * 35 + _stage * 175 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobPubKitchenPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 80 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你将鱼档直送的银鳕按小份佐酒、双拼正餐、水手大盘三档挂上冰啤脆浆，炸得外酥里嫩，水手长布兰德连叫三大盘并拍下重赏。" : "你控稳油温炸出金黄酥脆的银鳕鱼排，配酸黄瓜酱准时推出传菜窗。")>>
		<<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) + 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "面糊调得太稀，下锅后散成一锅碎渣，鱼肉也粘了锅底，厨娘黑着脸让你先把油锅滤干净。">>
		<<stress 5>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchen to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertgain "热油锅翻滚的滋啦声">><<else>><<link [[猛火炸鱼排 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "猛火炸鱼排">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 5500 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[搬酒桶冰块 (1:00)|MP Job PubKitchen Settle]]>><<mpalert 8>>
	<<set _sk to ($physique or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 7500 or _stage gte 2 or random(5200, 7600) lte (_sk + _stage * 800))>>
	<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (410 + _stage * 170 + Math.floor(_sk / 120) - (($mpJobPubKitchenPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 75 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你一鼓作气把四只橡木酒桶稳稳扛上地窖石阶，又用木槌敲开铅封接上铜龙头。酒保朝你竖起大拇指，分了你一份力气钱。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "酒窖石阶湿滑，你搬到半途脚下一软，木桶顺着台阶滚落撞裂了桶箍，麦酒流了一地。厨娘让你赶紧拿拖把去清地窖，工钱自然泡了汤。">>
		<<stress 5>><<pain 3>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchen to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertgain "酒桶滚下石阶的闷响">><<else>><<link [[搬酒桶冰块 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "搬酒桶冰块">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：7500（或已获配酒窖副匙）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[削薯刷盘 (1:00)|MP Job PubKitchen Settle]]>><<mpalert -5>>
	<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) + 1>>
	<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (310 + _stage * 90 - (($mpJobPubKitchenPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 50 : 0)))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "你坐在小木凳上削完满满两竹筐马铃薯，又用碱水把油腻的锡盘刷得反光。虽然满手水汽，但稳稳拿到了当日工钱。">>
	<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchen to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertloss "守在水槽边削洗">>
<</if>>


:: MP Job PubKitchen Progress [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
你站在酒馆后厨与地窖交界的石阶旁，墙上的黑板用粉笔写着今晚的炖菜锅数与存酒桶号。
<br><br>
<<if _stage is 0>>
	你还在水槽边干削皮刷碗的粗活，厨娘不许你单独碰铁板和香料罐。
<<elseif _stage is 1>>
	厨娘开始让你在传菜窗切配冷盘，跑堂伙计们也记住了你的名字。
<<elseif _stage is 2>>
	你已经能独自照看炖肉大锅的火候，打烊后还能分到一碗热乎的浓汤。
<<elseif _stage is 3>>
	厨娘把地窖副匙栓在了你的腰带上。
<<else>>
	整个丰收街酒馆后厨的备料与菜单都离不开你。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "PubKitchen">>
<br><br>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回灶台 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看后厨当班活 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[去后厨灶间复工 (0:03)|MP Job PubKitchen Remedy]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<elseif ($mpJobPubKitchenStrike or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobPubKitchenPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<link [[补厨下差错 (0:03)|MP Job PubKitchen StrikeFix]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Duties [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你扫了一眼后厨黑板上的加菜粉笔字，准备应付今日的厨房忙活。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后厨排班 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 3>><<mpcookicon>><<link [[炖黑啤牛肉 (0:07)|MP Job Followup PubKitchen]]>><<pass 7>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryPubKitchen or 0) lt 3>><<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[慢煨百年老卤 (0:06)|MP Job Story PubKitchen 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobPubKitchen>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[抢修地窖冰槽 (0:05)|MP Job Extra PubKitchen 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Remedy [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenSuspended or 0) isnt 1>><<goto "MP Job PubKitchen Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
由于连续三次在后厨闯祸，厨娘暂时不准你上灶。<br><br>
	<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[送空酒桶 (0:16)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenPenalty to 0>>
		<<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 16>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpsmokeicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<link [[刷净烟罩 (0:14)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>>
		<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 14>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[刷净烟罩 (0:14)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "刷净烟罩">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 14>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 7800>><<link [[码正酒架 (0:14)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>>
		<<if ($physique or 0) gte 7800>>
			<<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress -1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 14>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[码正酒架 (0:14)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "码正酒架">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：7800">><<pass 14>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job PubKitchen StrikeFix [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenStrike or 0) is 2 or ($mpJobPubKitchenPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	厨娘暂时收回了你的地窖副匙与宵夜热汤优待，把你的工钱压了一成。
	<br><br>
	<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[刷净酒壶 (0:12)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobPubKitchenPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 12>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[请酒保美言 (0:06)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>>
		<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobPubKitchenPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to 1>><<stress -1>><<pass 6>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 3>><<pass 6>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[请酒保美言 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "请酒保美言">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<<elseif ($mpJobPubKitchenStrike or 0) is 1>>
	厨娘还记着你上一回洒汤砸桶的事，催你干活时嗓门比平时大了些。
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[清净排水沟 (0:06)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job PubKitchen Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobPubKitchenCount to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobPubKitchenCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<print ($mpJobResultText or "你擦干手上的水珠，把厨刀插回木刀架。")>>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
	<<money $mpJobResultPay>><<housekeeping 1>><<tending 1>>
	<<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2 or ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 6>><<money 140>>厨娘夸赞码头直送的去刺银鳕鲜嫩肥美，把今夜招牌炸鱼排的抽成也分了你一份。<</if>>
	厨娘在油腻的围裙上擦了擦手，从铁盒里数出工钱塞进你兜里。
	<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobPubKitchenStrike - 1)>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set _msClaimed to (_stage gte 3 and window.dolmp and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_milestone"))>>
	<<if !_msClaimed>>
		<<set _ev to random(1, 5)>>
		<<switch _ev>>
		<<case 1>><<include "MP Job Random PubKitchen 1">>
		<<case 2>><<include "MP Job Random PubKitchen 2">>
		<<case 3>><<include "MP Job Random PubKitchen 3">>
		<<case 4>><<include "MP Job Random PubKitchen 4">>
		<<case 5>><<include "MP Job Random PubKitchen 5">>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _stage gte 3>>
		<<if _msClaimed>>
			<br><br>
			收工前，厨娘把酒窖副匙和一卷沉甸甸的硬币拍在你掌心：「后厨有你盯着，我总算能喘口气了，这是给你的红利。」
			<<money 1800>><<stress -3>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobPubKitchenStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobPubKitchenStrike or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if $mpJobPubKitchenStrike is 2>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenPenalty to 1>><<elseif $mpJobPubKitchenStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobPubKitchenSuspended to 1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpJobPubKitchenStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure PubKitchen 1">>
	<<elseif $mpJobPubKitchenStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure PubKitchen 2">>
	<<else>><<include "MP Job Failure PubKitchen 3">><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0 and !($daily and $daily.mpJobPubKitchenEncounter)>>
	传菜口外的铜铃又被敲得叮当乱响，前厅跑堂正探头催单。
	<br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[传菜口敲铜铃 (0:05)|MP Job PubKitchen Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看排班 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后厨 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

/* ==================== 5. 河湾马厩驮运 (Stable) ==================== */

:: MP Job Stable [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 20)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开农场马厩 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobStableCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobStableCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobStableCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobStableCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
农田边界的木制马厩里弥漫着干苜蓿草与皮革鞍具的气味，几匹挽马正低头嚼着燕麦。车夫老伯拿着铁刷清理马蹄铁上的泥块，院子中央停着两辆装满谷袋的四轮板车。
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobStable>>
	挽马已经卸了挽具回栏歇息，你的皮护腕也挂在了木柱上。老伯朝你摆摆手，示意今天的驮运活已经收工。
<<elseif _stage gte 3 and ($mpJobStablePenalty or 0) is 0>>
	老伯把最温顺健壮的栗色领头马缰绳递到你手里，还把鞍袋里备用的热麦茶壶留给你路上喝。
<<else>>
	老伯拍了拍板车栏板：「先把草料添足，等会儿要把这批谷袋和木桶稳稳当当运到镇口交接。」
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>>草料棚里堆满了河湾农场新收的甜苜蓿与燕麦，挽马吃得膘肥体壮。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 6>>丰收街酒馆后厨每晚留下的温热麦酒糟，成了挽马冬日最受用的暖胃拌料。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobCourierCount or 0) gte 6>>街巷跑腿行的远郊大宗急件常由你的车队在镇口接力捎带。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Stable">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Stable">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobStableSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	老伯把马厩木栏插上了横栓。因为接连惊马翻车，你已被暂停跟车，得先把马厩里的积活处理妥当。
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去马厩销假 (0:04)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobStable)>>
	<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[戴护腕套车 (1:00)|MP Job Stable Shift]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看马队排班 (0:03)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
马厩已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Stable Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobStableSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Stable Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobStableCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobStableCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobStableCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobStableCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回马厩院内 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobStable>>
	河湾马厩今日的车队草料与挽具已经打理完毕，马棚木门落了栓。
<<else>>
田间土路被露水浸得松软，两匹年轻挽马因为远处的雷鸣声有些焦躁地刨着前蹄。板车上摞着十袋新磨的麦粉与几篓易碎的鸡蛋，正等着发车。
<<if random(1, 3) is 1>>
<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Stable Winter">>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Stable Rain">>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Stable Festival">>
<<elseif Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Stable Spring">>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Stable Summer">>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 3>><<link [[控缰驾辕 (1:00)|MP Job Stable Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($tending or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 270 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 280) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (450 + _stage * 185 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobStablePenalty or 0) is 1 ? 85 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你顺着栗色挽马的脖颈轻柔摩挲，用平稳的口哨声压下它的躁动，稳稳控着双缰穿过泥泞坡道。整车鸡蛋与麦粉完好无损地交到了高街粮商手里。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "挽马被路边的飞鸟惊得猛然尥蹶子，你没拽住副缰，车轮斜陷进田沟里，震碎了最上面一篓鸡蛋。老伯赶来把车拖出泥坑，沉着脸说今天没法给你算工钱。">>
		<<stress 6>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobStable to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[控缰驾辕 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "控缰驾辕">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管领头马缰绳）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsmithicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 200 or ($physique or 0) gte 6800 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[修蹄检掌 (1:00)|MP Job Stable Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($science or 0), Math.floor(($physique or 0) / 30))>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 250 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 260) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _tier to (_sk gte 310 or _stage gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (410 + _tier * 35 + _stage * 170 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobStablePenalty or 0) is 1 ? 75 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你按轻便邮马、短驳板车马、重载领头马三档修整蹄缘并铆紧精钢掌钉，铁匠巴尔德与粮商吉尔伯特验过后赞不绝口。" : "你替出车的挽马清净蹄底碎石、敲紧松动的掌钉，车队稳稳当当上了路。")>>
		<<set $mpJobReg_Stable_2 to ($mpJobReg_Stable_2 or 0) + 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "起旧掌钉时手滑磕伤了指节，挽马受惊不肯抬蹄，老马夫只得接手重钉，这班没算工钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 2>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobStable to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[修蹄检掌 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "修蹄检掌">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：6800">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[押桶过桥 (1:00)|MP Job Stable Settle]]>>
	<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 2 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (400 + _stage * 165 + Math.floor(_sk / 6) - (($mpJobStablePenalty or 0) is 1 ? 75 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你在颠簸的石桥坡道上一路小跑扶稳车尾，用双套结把松动的木桶死死勒在车栏上，赶在雨落前把货卸进了丰收街仓库。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "过桥时绳结滑脱，一只装苹果汁的木桶滚下车尾摔裂了木塞。你满身汗水地把剩下的桶推回马厩，这一趟只能白干。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobStable to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<else>><<link [[押桶过桥 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "押桶过桥">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已熟稔押车绳结）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[铡草刷马 (1:00)|MP Job Stable Settle]]>>
	<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0) + 1>>
	<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (320 + _stage * 90 - (($mpJobStablePenalty or 0) is 1 ? 50 : 0)))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "你把干草铡碎拌好麦麸倒进食槽，又拿着硬毛刷把四匹挽马的鬃毛刷得顺滑发亮。老伯满意地点点头，把工钱递给你。">>
	<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobStable to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Job Stable Progress [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobStableCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobStableCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobStableCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobStableCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
你站在马厩檐下的木挂架旁，上面整齐挂着铜马铃、备用肚带与各庄园的送货木牌。
<br><br>
<<if _stage is 0>>
	你才刚来马厩帮工，老伯只让你在院里递草料、看车轮，不许你独自牵马出栏。
<<elseif _stage is 1>>
	老伯开始让你跟着板车跑近郊短线，马厩里的几匹挽马一闻到你的气味就会亲昵地喷响鼻。
<<elseif _stage is 2>>
	你已经能独自赶着轻便马车往高街送货，<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>>亚历克斯<<else>>年轻农夫<</if>>见了你也会顺手递一篮鲜果让你捎上。
<<elseif _stage is 3>>
	领头栗色马的专用铜铃归你掌管。
<<else>>
	整支河湾驮运车队的排班与远线押运都由你拿主意。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Stable">>
<br><br>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院内 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[看马厩当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Stable Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<if ($mpJobStableSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去马厩院内复工 (0:03)|MP Job Stable Remedy]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<elseif ($mpJobStableStrike or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobStablePenalty or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<link [[补草料差错 (0:03)|MP Job Stable StrikeFix]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Stable Duties [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你摸了摸马厩檐下的铜铃木牌，查看今日的驮运加急趟与老主顾。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回马队排班 (0:02)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobStableCount or 0) gte 3>><<mpsmithicon>><<link [[调试马镫 (0:08)|MP Job Followup Stable]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobStableCount or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryStable or 0) lt 3>><<mpanimalicon>><<link [[调护领头栗马 (0:06)|MP Job Story Stable 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobStable>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[抢修松脱车轴 (0:05)|MP Job Extra Stable 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Stable Remedy [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobStableSuspended or 0) isnt 1>><<goto "MP Job Stable Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
因为接连惊马翻货，老伯暂时不让你碰缰绳。<br><br>
	<<mpsmithicon>><<link [[送马掌 (0:15)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobStableStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobStableSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobStablePenalty to 0>>
		<<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 15>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpfirstaidicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 270>><<link [[敷药包扎 (0:13)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>>
		<<if ($tending or 0) gte 270>>
			<<set $mpJobStableStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobStableSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobStablePenalty to 0>>
			<<stress -1>><<pass 13>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 13>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[敷药包扎 (0:13)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "敷药包扎">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 13>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<investigateicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($physique or 0) gte 7800>><<link [[填平泥沟 (0:15)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>>
		<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($physique or 0) gte 7800>>
			<<set $mpJobStableStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobStableSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobStablePenalty to 0>>
			<<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 15>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 15>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[填平泥沟 (0:15)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "填平泥沟">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 体魄：7800">><<pass 15>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Stable StrikeFix [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobStableStrike or 0) is 2 or ($mpJobStablePenalty or 0) is 1>>
	老伯暂时收回了你的远线押运资格与铜马铃，只让你在院里干杂活。
	<br><br>
	<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[给鞍具抹油 (0:12)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobStablePenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobStableStrike to 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 12>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<if mpNpcMet("Alex")>><<walkicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>><<link [[请亚历克斯说情 (0:06)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>>
		<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>>
			<<set $mpJobStablePenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobStableStrike to 1>><<stress -1>><<pass 6>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 3>><<pass 6>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[请亚历克斯说情 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "请亚历克斯说情">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>><<else>><</if>>
<<elseif ($mpJobStableStrike or 0) is 1>>
	老伯还记着你上一趟翻篓子的事，套车前特意检查了两遍你的绳结。
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[换马栏垫草 (0:06)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobStableStrike to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 6>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Stable Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Stable Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpJobStableCount to ($mpJobStableCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobStableCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobStableCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobStableCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobStableCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<print ($mpJobResultText or "你把挽具挂回木桩，拍了拍马背上的草屑。")>>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
	<<money $mpJobResultPay>><<tending 1>><<athletics 1>>
	<<if ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 2>><<money 120>>老伯拍着吃饱了河湾新苜蓿的挽马，乐呵呵地多塞给你几枚跑车赏钱。<</if>>
	车夫老伯从皮腰包里点出铜币与纸钞，笑着塞进你手里。
	<<if ($mpJobStableStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobStableStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobStableStrike - 1)>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set _msClaimed to (_stage gte 3 and window.dolmp and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_stable_milestone"))>>
	<<if !_msClaimed>>
		<<set _ev to random(1, 5)>>
		<<switch _ev>>
		<<case 1>><<include "MP Job Random Stable 1">>
		<<case 2>><<include "MP Job Random Stable 2">>
		<<case 3>><<include "MP Job Random Stable 3">>
		<<case 4>><<include "MP Job Random Stable 4">>
		<<case 5>><<include "MP Job Random Stable 5">>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _stage gte 3>>
		<<if _msClaimed>>
			<br><br>
			收工时，老伯把一枚黄铜护鞍扣和一袋远线红利交到你手上：「这几匹马现在比听我的话还服你，往后大车队就归你带头了。」
			<<money 1900>><<stress -3>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobStableStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobStableStrike or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if $mpJobStableStrike is 2>><<set $mpJobStablePenalty to 1>><<elseif $mpJobStableStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobStableSuspended to 1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpJobStableStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Stable 1">>
	<<elseif $mpJobStableStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Stable 2">>
	<<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Stable 3">><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0 and !($daily and $daily.mpJobStableEncounter)>>
	马厩外院忽然传来一阵急促的马嘶与车轮声，老马夫朝你招了招手。
	<br>
	<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[马栏外起响鼻 (0:05)|MP Job Stable Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看马队 (0:02)|MP Job Stable Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院子 (0:02)|MP Job Stable]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

/* ==================== 6. 旧港近海渔船 (Trawler) ==================== */

:: MP Job Trawler [nobr]
<<set _jobOpen to (Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 21)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if _jobOpen>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTrawlerCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
旧港三号防波堤下系着一艘涂着黑焦油的单桅拖网渔船，柴油机突突地冒着白烟。老船老大叼着短烟斗站在甲板边，水手们正往底舱搬运碎冰与鱼筐。
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobTrawler>>
	拖网已经沥干挂上了桅杆，你的防水油布裤也搭在船舷边。船老大朝你挥了挥烟斗，示意今天的潮水已经跑完了。
<<elseif _stage gte 3 and ($mpJobTrawlerPenalty or 0) is 0>>
	船老大把驾驶台旁的铜罗盘与防风油布衣留给你，连外礁深水区的起网时机都听你的号令。
<<else>>
	船老大用鞋尖踢了踢甲板上的麻缆：「近海浪急，上船先把防滑靴系紧，起网的时候千万别被缆绳缠住脚。」
<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>>海礁鱼档与船队互通潮位表，起出的头水银鳕靠岸便能直接过秤交割。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 2>>驾驶台上的黄铜罗盘与气压表刚由高街钟表铺除锈充磁，指向分毫不差。<</if>>
<<if ($mpJobPubKitchenCount or 0) gte 6>>丰收街酒馆后厨预订了今晚的深海青蟹，还给船舱备了一桶驱寒的姜汁麦茶。<</if>>
<br><<mpJobSeasonWeather "Trawler">>
<br><<mpJobRegularPresence "Trawler">>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	船老大把登船跳板拉回了一半。由于接连在甲板上漏网误事，你已被暂停出海，得先把岸上的修船补网活干完。
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去船头销假 (0:04)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif !($daily and $daily.mpJobTrawler)>>
	<<swimicon>><<link [[穿油布衣上船 (1:00)|MP Job Trawler Shift]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看船队排班 (0:03)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<else>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
拖网渔船已经打烊了，窗里只亮着一盏值夜灯。你决定改天再来。
<</if>>

:: MP Job Trawler Shift [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerSuspended or 0) is 1>><<goto "MP Job Trawler Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTrawlerCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回渔船跳板 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobTrawler>>
	近海拖网船今日的渔获已经全部卸舱过秤，甲板与渔网冲洗得干干净净。
<<else>>
渔船驶出防波堤外，咸冷的海浪拍打着船头，成群的海鸥追着尾流盘旋。船尾的拖网绞盘发出沉闷的吱呀声，网兜在灰绿色的海面下沉甸甸地绷紧了。
<<if random(1, 3) is 1>>
<<if Weather.isSnow>><<include "MP Job Seasonal Trawler Winter">>
<<elseif Weather.precipitation isnot "none">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Trawler Rain">>
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Trawler Festival">>
<<elseif Time.season is "spring">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Trawler Spring">>
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">><<include "MP Job Seasonal Trawler Summer">>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<swimicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 3>><<link [[解网起鱼 (1:00)|MP Job Trawler Settle]]>><<mpalert 6>>
	<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 280 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 290) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (480 + _stage * 195 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobTrawlerPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 90 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你抓紧安全绳探身入水，趁着涌浪抬升的瞬间用钩竿挑开卡在礁石上的底纲。满满一网银鳕鱼与大蟹轰然倾入甲板，船老大乐得合不拢嘴。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "一个冷浪扑面打来，你呛了一口咸水，手里的钩竿没挑开底纲反而扯裂了网袋，大半鱼群顺着破口逃得无影无踪。船老大黑着脸下令收船，这趟出海白忙活了。">>
		<<stress 6>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTrawler to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertgain "渔网砸上甲板的水声">><<else>><<link [[解网起鱼 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "解网起鱼">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已掌管船头罗盘）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 200 or ($maths or 0) gte 200 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[看潮掌舵 (1:00)|MP Job Trawler Settle]]>><<mpalert 4>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($science or 0), ($maths or 0))>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 3 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _tier to (_sk gte 320 or _stage gte 4 ? 3 : 2)>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (440 + _tier * 35 + _stage * 180 + Math.floor(_sk / 5) - (($mpJobTrawlerPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 80 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to (_tier is 3 ? "你对照黄铜罗盘与外礁潮位线，按近岸银鱼带、中层黑鲷群、深海青鳕沟三档精准压舵走船，鱼商克劳斯在岸边全舱高价包圆。" : "你稳稳把住舵轮避开暗流旋涡，让拖网始终贴着鱼群最密的水层前行。")>>
		<<set $mpJobReg_Trawler_1 to ($mpJobReg_Trawler_1 or 0) + 1>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "横流把船头推偏了半度，拖网刮上浅滩空兜而归，独眼船长接过舵轮让你去底舱反思。">>
		<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTrawler to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertgain "柴油机转向时的低沉轰鸣">><<else>><<link [[看潮掌舵 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "看潮掌舵">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 算术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mprowicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 180 or _stage gte 2>><<link [[摇绞盘收缆 (1:00)|MP Job Trawler Settle]]>><<mpalert 8>>
	<<set _sk to ($athletics or 0)>>
	<<set _ok to (_sk gte 260 or _stage gte 2 or random(170, 270) lte (_sk + _stage * 35))>>
	<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) + 1 + (_ok ? 1 : 0)>>
	<<if _ok>>
		<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (420 + _stage * 170 + Math.floor(_sk / 6) - (($mpJobTrawlerPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 80 : 0)))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "你双脚死死钉在湿滑的甲板上，随着船身起伏的节拍稳稳扳动棘轮，将百斤重的渔网一寸寸绞上船尾。码头鱼商当场按最高价收走了这批鲜货。">>
	<<else>>
		<<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
		<<set $mpJobResultText to "船身猛晃了一下，你脚底打滑松开了绞盘手柄，倒转的铁柄撞青了你的手臂，鱼筐也翻进了海里。船老大叹着气让你坐去舱口歇着，今天分不到船份钱。">>
		<<stress 5>><<pain 3>><<tiredness 3>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTrawler to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertgain "绞盘棘轮的空转声">><<else>><<link [[摇绞盘收缆 (1:00)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摇绞盘收缆">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>（或已熟稔甲板绞盘）">><<pass 60>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[底舱分拣 (1:00)|MP Job Trawler Settle]]>><<mpalert 4>>
	<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) + 1>>
	<<set _pay to Math.min(6000, 4 * (330 + _stage * 95 - (($mpJobTrawlerPenalty or 0) is 1 ? 50 : 0)))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultPay to Math.round(_pay * (((($mpGuildStanding and $mpGuildStanding.wageMod) or 100)) / 100))>>
	<<set $mpJobResultText to "你在底舱将比目鱼、青鱼与海蟹按大小码进木箱，一层层铺实碎冰。虽然手指被冰得通红，但靠岸时稳稳领到了水手份子钱。">>
	<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobTrawler to 1>><<pass 60>>
<</link>><<mpalertgain "鱼筐在底舱拖动的闷响">>
<</if>>


:: MP Job Trawler Progress [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTrawlerCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
你站在防波堤网架旁，查看晾晒的麻网与船舷吃水线。
<br><br>
<<if _stage is 0>>
	你才刚上船见习，船老大只准你在底舱铲冰分鱼，风浪稍大就不让你靠近船舷。
<<elseif _stage is 1>>
	你已经习惯了甲板的摇晃，水手们开始让你一起扳绞盘，不再把你当旱鸭子看。
<<elseif _stage is 2>>
	船老大开始教你辨认外礁海流的颜色，每次返航还会给你留两条最新鲜的银鳕鱼。
<<elseif _stage is 3>>
	你在船首有了专属的防风油布衣与安全扣。
<<else>>
	整艘拖网渔船的起网号令与近海航线都由你掌舵。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<mpJobRegularRoster "Trawler">>
<br><br>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回跳板 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<link [[看渔船当班活 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler Duties]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerSuspended or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去拖网船复工 (0:03)|MP Job Trawler Remedy]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<elseif ($mpJobTrawlerStrike or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobTrawlerPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	<br>
	<<mprepairicon>><<link [[补甲板差错 (0:03)|MP Job Trawler StrikeFix]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Trawler Duties [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你站在防波堤网架旁望了望潮水，核对今日的渔船急活与老船长交待。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回船队排班 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 3>><<mpsewicon>><<link [[复查主网纲 (0:08)|MP Job Followup Trawler]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0) gte 3 and ($mpJobStoryTrawler or 0) lt 3>><<mpmapicon>><<link [[探航黑礁深沟 (0:06)|MP Job Story Trawler 1]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $daily and $daily.mpJobTrawler>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[抢修卡死绞盘 (0:05)|MP Job Extra Trawler 1]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Trawler Remedy [nobr]
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerSuspended or 0) isnt 1>><<goto "MP Job Trawler Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
因为接连在海上漏网脱钩，船老大暂时不准你登船。<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[扛缆上船头 (0:16)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerPenalty to 0>>
		<<stress 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 16>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpfishicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 270 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>><<link [[补好拖网 (0:14)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>>
		<<if ($tending or 0) gte 270 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270>>
			<<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress -1>><<pass 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 14>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[补好拖网 (0:14)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "补好拖网">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 14>><</link>><</if>>
	<br>
	<<mprowicon>><<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 280>><<link [[清理船底 (0:14)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>>
		<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 280>>
			<<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerSuspended to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerPenalty to 0>>
			<<stress 1>><<tiredness 2>><<pass 14>>
		<<else>>
			<<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 14>>
		<</if>>
	<</link>>
<<else>><<link [[清理船底 (0:14)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "清理船底">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "游泳等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 14>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Job Trawler StrikeFix [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回排班架 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobTrawlerStrike or 0) is 2 or ($mpJobTrawlerPenalty or 0) is 1>>
	船老大暂时收回了你的老水手分红与鲜鱼福利，只按学徒标准给你算贴补。
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[刷净甲板 (0:13)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobTrawlerPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to 1>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 3>><<pass 13>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>
		<<if ($money or 0) gte 200>>
			<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[请维斯喝一杯 (0:06)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>>
				<<money -200>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 260>>
					<<set $mpJobTrawlerPenalty to 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to 1>><<stress -1>><<pass 6>>
				<<else>>
					<<stress 3>><<pass 6>>
				<</if>>
			<</link>>
		<<else>><span class="disabled">请维斯喝一杯 (0:06)（钱不够）</span><</if>>
	<<else>><</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif ($mpJobTrawlerStrike or 0) is 1>>
	船老大还记着你上一趟破网的事，出海前特意盯着你系了两遍安全绳。
	<br><br>
	<<mprowicon>><<link [[盘齐锚链 (0:06)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>>
		<<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to 0>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Trawler Settle [nobr]
<<if !$mpJobResultText>><<goto "MP Job Trawler Progress">><</if>>
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "docks">><<mpalertinit "docks">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpJobTrawlerCount to ($mpJobTrawlerCount or 0)>>
<<set _stage to ($mpJobTrawlerCount gte 15 ? 4 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 10 ? 3 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 6 ? 2 : $mpJobTrawlerCount gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>>
<<print ($mpJobResultText or "渔船稳稳靠上三号防波堤，你踏着跳板走回岸边。")>>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0>>
	<<money $mpJobResultPay>><<swimmingskill 1>><<athletics 1>>
	<<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>><<money 140>>船老大夸你摸透了海礁栈桥的潮位表，分鱼时特意给你多拨了一份头等船份钱。<</if>>
	船老大在秤台边跟鱼商结清货款，当场分出你的那份船钱拍在你手心。
	<<if ($mpJobTrawlerStrike or 0) gt 0>><<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to Math.max(0, $mpJobTrawlerStrike - 1)>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<set _msClaimed to (_stage gte 3 and window.dolmp and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward and window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_trawler_milestone"))>>
	<<if !_msClaimed>>
		<<set _ev to random(1, 5)>>
		<<switch _ev>>
		<<case 1>><<include "MP Job Random Trawler 1">>
		<<case 2>><<include "MP Job Random Trawler 2">>
		<<case 3>><<include "MP Job Random Trawler 3">>
		<<case 4>><<include "MP Job Random Trawler 4">>
		<<case 5>><<include "MP Job Random Trawler 5">>
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<<if _stage gte 3>>
		<<if _msClaimed>>
			<br><br>
			下船前，船老大把一枚刻着海锚的黄铜船哨和一叠分红钞票递给你：「你在风浪里的手艺已经不输老水手了，这是给你的头等船份。」
			<<money 2000>><<stress -3>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpJobTrawlerStrike to Math.min(3, ($mpJobTrawlerStrike or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if $mpJobTrawlerStrike is 2>><<set $mpJobTrawlerPenalty to 1>><<elseif $mpJobTrawlerStrike gte 3>><<set $mpJobTrawlerSuspended to 1>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if $mpJobTrawlerStrike is 1>><<include "MP Job Failure Trawler 1">>
	<<elseif $mpJobTrawlerStrike is 2>><<include "MP Job Failure Trawler 2">>
	<<else>><<include "MP Job Failure Trawler 3">><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpJobResultPay or 0) gt 0 and !($daily and $daily.mpJobTrawlerEncounter)>>
	甲板船头忽然传来两声短促的哨响，大副正指着海面喊人。
	<br>
	<<swimicon>><<link [[甲板传来哨响 (0:05)|MP Job Trawler Encounter Router]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<set $mpJobResultText to "">><<set $mpJobResultPay to 0>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看船队 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler Progress]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回船头 (0:02)|MP Job Trawler]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

